questions.question_text:
How many lines of symmetry does this square have?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (3.6,3.6);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

What is the order of rotational symmetry of this parallelogram?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) -- (4.4,0) -- (5.8,2.5) -- (1.4,2.5) -- cycle;
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Which labelled segments are lines of symmetry of this non-square rhombus?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\coordinate (A) at (-2.7,0); \coordinate (B) at (0,1.4); \coordinate (C) at (2.7,0); \coordinate (D) at (0,-1.4);
\draw (A)--(B)--(C)--(D)--cycle;
\draw[dashed] (A)--(C); \draw[dashed] (B)--(D);
\node[left] at (A) {$A$}; \node[above] at (B) {$B$}; \node[right] at (C) {$C$}; \node[below] at (D) {$D$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

State the number of lines of symmetry and the order of rotational symmetry of this kite.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,-2.5)--(1.6,0.3)--(0,1.9)--(-1.6,0.3)--cycle;
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

State the number of lines of symmetry and the order of rotational symmetry of this general parallelogram, which is neither a rectangle nor a rhombus.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[rotate=30,every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0)--(4.6,0)--(5.5,1.9)--(0.9,1.9)--cycle;
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

What is the order of rotational symmetry of this non-square rectangle?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (4.7,2.4);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
